around the world can order/gift our products to anywhere in Sri Lanka', 'Online marketplace', '', 'https://anythingatsupun.lk', '["online sell","Island wide delivery"]', '/uploads/1785482279193-184621226-Untitled design (3).png', '2025-10-13 11:48:28', '2026-07-31 07:55:31', NULL, '0777554477', NULL, 'anythingatsupun.lk@gmail.com', NULL, '["/uploads/1760416064746-101650089-Screenshot%202025-10-14%20094301.png","/uploads/1760416064762-641750804-Screenshot%202025-10-14%20094641.png","/uploads/1760416064765-664939890-Screenshot%202025-10-14%20094611.png","/uploads/1785484531070-682562158-Screenshot 2026-07-31 132515.png"]', 4, '[{"name":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/Anythingatsupun.lk/"},{"name":"Instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/anythingatsupun.lk/"}]', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/kYGdjnqVLLDyfdUf6');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO companies (id, name, shortName, description, fullDescription, industry, established, website, features, imageUrl, createdAt, updatedAt, catalogPdf, phone, hotline, email, faxNumber, gallery, sequence, socialLinks, googleMapsLink) VALUES ('fuji', 'Fuji Industries Pvt Ltd', 'Fuji Industries', 'Fuji Industries is our advanced manufacturing facility for air conditioners and fans. ', 'Under our brands — Fuji, Camy AC, and Dione Fan — we deliver reliable, energy-efficient, and innovative cooling solutions to meet both residential and commercial needs.', 'Manufacturing', '', '', '["manifucturing","air conditioner manifucture","fan manifucture"]', '/uploads/1760357428290-547294273-IMG-20251007-WA0218.jpg', '2025-10-13 12:10:28', '2026-08-24 08:38:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["/uploads/1785482438833-464235852-IMG-20251007-WA0218.jpg","/uploads/1785482438833-341073317-IMG-20251007-WA0217.jpg","/uploads/1785482438834-687238164-IMG-20251007-WA0216.jpg","/uploads/1785482438835-450501269-IMG-20251007-WA0213.jpg","/uploads/1785482438837-211619367-IMG-20251007-WA0212.jpg","/uploads/1785482438838-301340107-IMG-20251007-WA0211.jpg","/uploads/1785482438839-960800714-IMG-20251007-WA0210.jpg","/uploads/1785482438839-170396397-IMG-20251007-WA0209.jpg"]', 7, '[]', NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO companies (id, name, shortName, description, fullDescription, industry, established, website, features, imageUrl, createdAt, updatedAt, catalogPdf, phone, hotline, email, faxNumber, gallery, sequence, socialLinks, googleMapsLink) VALUES ('rodsons', 'Rodsons (Pvt) Ltd', 'Rodsons', 'The plastic moulding behind every Camy product.', 'Rodsons is the plastic moulding plant that makes the body parts the rest of the Camy manufacturing line depends on: the shells of Camy Smart helmets, the bodies of Camy wall clocks and mixer grinders, and components across the wider Camy product range.', 'Manufacturing', '2017', '', '["Plastic injection moulding, in-house tooling","Supplies body parts across the full Camy product range","High-precision polymer die casting","Supports helmet shells, mixer housings & appliance bodies"]', '/uploads/1785484405677-380967732-m (3).png', '2025-10-13 12:18:06', '2026-07-31 07:53:25', NULL, '+94 112 055 026', NULL, 'info@supungroup.lk', NULL, '[]', 7, '[]', NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO companies (id, name, shortName, description, fullDescription, industry, established, website, features, imageUrl, createdAt, updatedAt, catalogPdf, phone, hotline, email, faxNumber, gallery, sequence, socialLinks, googleMapsLink) VALUES ('supun-super-center', 'Supun Super Centre (Pvt) Ltd', 'Supun Super Center', 'Colombo''s one-stop retail destination.', 'Supun Super Center brings together a wide product range under one roof in the heart of Colombo. The company focuses on the right balance of price and quality for every customer. Its newest chapter is digital: Anythingatsupun.lk, the Group''s online marketplace, lets customers anywhere in the world order or gift products to anywhere in Sri Lanka.', 'Retail & Distribution', '2003', 'https://www.anythingatsupun.lk', '["Wide product range under one roof","Multi-brand retail in Colombo","Online ordering & gifting via Anythingatsupun.lk","Worldwide delivery to anywhere in Sri Lanka"]', '/uploads/1785482240652-854734715-Untitled design (2).png', '2026-08-23 19:33:17', '2026-08-23 19:33:17', NULL, '0112 504 920', NULL, 'anythingatsupun.lk@gmail.com', NULL, '[]', 2, '[]', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=16+R.A.+De+Mel+Mawatha+Colombo+00500');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO companies (id, name, shortName, description, fullDescription, industry, established, website, features, imageUrl, createdAt, updatedAt, catalogPdf, phone, hotline, email, faxNumber, gallery, sequence, socialLinks, googleMapsLink) VALUES ('supun-arcade-residency', 'Supun Arcade Residency (Pvt) Ltd', 'Supun Arcade Residency', 'Luxury serviced apartments and rooftop dining in Colombo.', 'Supun Arcade Residency offers fully furnished, air-conditioned suites in central Colombo, with panoramic ocean or city views. Guests enjoy a rooftop pool and 5-star hospitality, along with Area 56, the rooftop restaurant named for the property''s own address at 56 Galle Road, serving Asian and Western fusion cuisine.', 'Hospitality', '2010', 'https://www.supunarcaderesidency.com', '["40 luxury suites across 8 floors","Rooftop pool & Area 56 restaurant","Panoramic ocean and city views","5-star hospitality & central Colombo location"]', '/uploads/1785481183178-713193515-Screenshot 2026-07-31 122923.png', '2026-08-23 19:33:17', '2026-08-23 19:33:17', NULL, '0112 055 040', NULL, 'reservations@supunarcaderesidency.com', NULL, '[]', 3, '[]', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/B5DoY6ZqhckkcgQbA');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO companies (id, name, shortName, description, fullDescription, industry, established, website, features, imageUrl, createdAt, updatedAt, catalogPdf, phone, hotline, email, faxNumber, gallery, sequence, socialLinks, googleMapsLink) VALUES ('fuji-industries', 'Fuji Industries (Pvt) Ltd', 'Fuji Industries', 'Camy air conditioners and fans, made in Sri Lanka.', 'The Group''s newest manufacturing venture, Fuji Industries produces Camy air conditioners and Camy fans for residential and commercial customers, made in Sri Lanka.', 'Manufacturing', '2023', '', '["Camy air conditioners, made in Sri Lanka","Camy fans, made in Sri Lanka","Residential & commercial cooling solutions","The Group''s newest manufacturing facility"]', '/uploads/1760357428290-547294273-IMG-20251007-WA0218.jpg', '2026-08-23 19:33:18', '2026-08-23 19:33:18', NULL, '+94 112 055 026', NULL, 'info@supungroup.lk', NULL, '[]', 9, '[]', NULL);
